    "detailed_description": "\u2299Let the other person say the forbidden word!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2299A psychological chat game that takes care of your own forbidden word and draws out the other player's forbidden words!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2299The more you talk, the higher your score!<br />\r\n In the end, the person with the highest score wins, so you have to be careful about the other player's forbidden word and talk a lot.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nbut!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n You can ask for an explanation if another player says something strange!<br />\r\nClick on the strange message to ask for an explanation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2299200% fun by creating your own character!<br />\r\nYou can create your own character in the shop!<br />\r\nThe first custom is free!",
